# Local-only raw data downloads (~3GB) — too large for the repo and all
# re-downloadable from public sources:
# - sacs*.exe / sacs/: CDE SACS unaudited-actuals self-extracting archives and
#   the Access databases (.mdb) extracted from them (cde.ca.gov/ds/fd/fd/)
# - rcef.json: ProPublica Nonprofit Explorer API snapshot for the Redwood City
#   Education Foundation (EIN 94-2903141); a tracked copy lives in
#   data/analysis/rcef/
/sacs/
/sacs*.exe
/rcef.json

# Local working notes and analysis inputs. teacher-cost/ holds CDE J-90 salary
# archives, StaffFTE files, and BLS CPI series (~600MB of raw downloads); other
# drafts are private notes/email drafts that don't belong in a public repo.
# Derived findings + provenance docs are tracked in data/analysis/teacher-cost/.
/drafts/
